\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(3{x}_{i}+4{y}_{j}+15)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $3{x}_{i}+4{y}_{j}+15.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566370 #edb/ref 1080 "-\\frac{5}{2}{x}_{i}-2{y}_{j}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566370 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566370 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "05c26cb7-e498-58c2-926a-37ddb09c26ad" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566379 #edb/ref 1080 "-{x}_{i}+4{y}_{j}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566379 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566379 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "074e4e05-d3bb-55bd-8816-5010793ff112" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566415 #edb/ref 1080 "-23-13{x}_{i-1}-14{y}_{j-1}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566415 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566415 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1af10802-01e8-590a-8219-dfa60bf29a3f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566420 #edb/ref 1080 "15-3{x}_{i-1}^{2}-7{y}_{j-1}^{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566420 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566420 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1c3d1641-cb46-5e92-bf5f-abd201c6c1c7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566450 #edb/ref 1080 "{y}_{j}-{x}_{i-1}+5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566450 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566450 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2867ca93-342a-5654-9df2-3bbebf7bb504" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566481 #edb/ref 1080 "4{x}_{i}+7{y}_{j-1}-16" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566481 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566481 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "38f1076b-0cad-5d95-8f49-c8205cd8a58c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566482 #edb/ref 1080 "{x}_{i+1}^{3}+3{y}_{j-1}^{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186566482 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 175921